@startuml sequence-workflow
title Participation Trace — From a citizen's view to the final law
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

actor Citizen
participant "Web client" as Web
participant "API\n(role and scope checks)" as API
participant "Receipt service" as Receipts
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
actor "Clerk's Office" as Clerk
participant "Ingestion service\n(pdftotext / OCR)" as Ingest
participant "Linking service" as Link
participant "Gemini" as Gemini
actor Moderator
participant "Trace scripts\n(report, House, Act)" as Trace
participant "Mzalendo Hansard /\nfinal Act text" as Sources

== Submission (only while the committee's call for views is open) ==
Citizen -> Web : write a view on a bill (optional memorandum)
Web -> API : POST /receipts
API -> API : bill at "Public participation"?\none view per citizen per bill?
API -> Receipts : create receipt
Receipts -> DB : insert with hash = SHA-256(content + previous hash)\n(append-only: triggers reject UPDATE and DELETE)
API --> Web : public receipt ID, timestamp, hash
Web --> Citizen : receipt anyone can verify

== Committee report tabled ==
Clerk -> API : upload report PDF (own committee only)\nor nightly sync links Parliament's report
API -> Ingest : extract text (OCR fallback)
Ingest -> DB : report + one entry per issue\n(clause, summary, decision, reason)
Ingest -> Link : propose matches
Link -> Gemini : view + report entries
Gemini --> Link : entry, confidence, explanation
Link -> DB : pending match (low or manipulated scores capped)

== Human review ==
Moderator -> API : open review queue
Moderator -> API : confirm, or reject with a reason
API -> DB : decision recorded
API -> Citizen : bilingual notification of the outcome

== Following the view to the law (passed bills) ==
Trace -> Gemini : who said what in the report,\nand the committee's decision
Trace -> DB : report analysis
Trace -> Sources : Committee of the Whole House debate
Trace -> Gemini : what the House did with each adopted recommendation
Trace -> Trace : keep only if the cited Hansard lines record it
Trace -> Sources : final Act text
Trace -> Gemini : is each recommendation in the Act?
Trace -> Trace : keep only if the quoted wording is in the Act\nand was not already in the bill
Trace -> DB : House and Act traces (else "could not confirm")

== Anyone checks the outcome ==
Citizen -> Web : look up receipt
Web -> API : GET receipt, verify chain
API --> Web : stage: Received → With the committee →\nReport published → Response under review → outcome
Web --> Citizen : "From this view to the law":\ncommittee decision → House decision → final Act
@enduml
